<title>UK: GEC announces sale of Wire &amp; Cables Group.</title>
<headline>GEC announces sale of Wire &amp; Cables Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Company Plc said on Wednesday it had sold its Wire &amp; Cables Group to TT Group Plc for 16 million stg in cash.  </p>
<p>The Wire &amp; Cables Group reported a profit of 2.0 million stg on turnover of 197 million stg in the year ended March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>At completion the group had estimated net assets of 34 million stg made up of 58 million of capital employed less borrowings of 24 million, said GEC in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
